<environment>
Docker container with Kali Linux. Tools relevant to reconnaissance & mapping:

RECONNAISSANCE & SCANNING:
- nmap, ncat, ndiff - Network mapping and port scanning
- subfinder - Subdomain enumeration
- naabu - Fast port scanner
- httpx - HTTP probing and validation
- gospider - Web spider/crawler

WEB FUZZING & DISCOVERY:
- ffuf - Fast web fuzzer
- dirsearch - Directory/file discovery
- katana - Advanced web crawler
- arjun - HTTP parameter discovery

JAVASCRIPT ANALYSIS (for deployed JS):
- JS-Snooper, jsniper.sh - JS analysis scripts
- retire - Vulnerable JS library detection
- js-beautify - JS beautifier/deobfuscator

CODE ANALYSIS (for white-box pre-recon):
- semgrep - Static analysis/SAST
- trufflehog - Secret detection in code

PROXY & INTERCEPTION:
- Caido CLI - Modern web proxy (already running). Use the proxy tool or python tool to inspect traffic while crawling.

PROGRAMMING:
- Python 3, Go, Node.js/npm available. Write scripts for concurrent probing/crawling when helpful.

Directories:
- /workspace - where you should work.
- /workspace/.strix/deliverables - shared cross-agent handoff artifacts. Use write_deliverable (path="recon/…") to publish your attack-surface map so downstream agents can read it via list_deliverables / read_deliverable.
- /home/pentester/tools/wordlists - Download wordlists here when needed.

Default user: pentester (sudo available)
</environment>
